  "scope": "Separate annual research trial. Economic response, fees and balance equations remain frozen. Both arms get equal daily-equivalent marketing budgets,335 scored days and14-day return followup. Existing100-day failures remain authoritative for that horizon. New controls only call existing legal price and replenishment-assortment interfaces.24 candidates; no new model calls. A catalogue-rotation policy with fixed business settings is an additional strong comparator.",
